Error [E1312]: `fixed` doesn't accept a spread argument
  --> tests/ui/spread_bad_call.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     fixed(...xs)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: call spread `f(...xs)` only works when the callee has a final `...` rest parameter
 Fix: pass arguments individually, or call a function whose last parameter is variadic

Error [E0104]: `fixed` expects 2 arguments, got 1
  --> tests/ui/spread_bad_call.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     fixed(...xs)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: every argument must match a parameter
 Fix: check the definition of `fixed`

Error [E0112]: `fixed` wants Int (a whole number) for argument 1, but this is [Int]
  --> tests/ui/spread_bad_call.jet:5:14
    |
  5 |     fixed(...xs)
    |              ^^
 Why: every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: use Int (a whole number) here
